{
  "_webhook_config": {
    "webhook_secret_key": "merchant_secret",
    "signature_algorithm": "sha256(merchant_secret + totalAmount + currency + responseTimeStamp + PPP_TransactionID + Status + productId), lower-case hex; the secret is PREPENDED, unlike every request-side Nuvei checksum, which appends it. productId contributes the literal NA when the parameter is absent (UD-04). Nuvei configures SHA-256 or MD5 per SiteId (UD-09); the connector tries SHA-256 first and falls back to MD5.",
    "signature_location": "body parameter advanceResponseChecksum of the application/x-www-form-urlencoded Payment DMN, so the harness cannot inject it into a header; the values below are pre-computed against the Nuvei sandbox merchant_secret in creds.json. The deprecated responseChecksum has no published formula and is never used.",
    "note": "Family (a) Payment DMN only. Nuvei has no dedicated refund DMN and no dedicated dispute DMN: a refund arrives as transactionType=Credit and a dispute as transactionType=Chargeback (family a) and/or as a Control Panel Event with EventType=Chargeback (family b, JSON with the checksum in an unpublished HTTP header - spec gap G-04), which is why no chargeback fixture is pinned here. Bodies are base64 for the proto bytes field."
  },
